{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00100","headline":"太子纳妃太平公主出降 · 高宗皇帝","name":"太子纳妃太平公主出降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙楼光曙景，鲁馆啓朝扉。\n艳日浓妆影，低星降婺辉。\n玉庭浮瑞色，银牓藻祥徽。\n云转花萦盖，霞飘叶缀旗。\n雕轩回翠陌，宝驾归丹殿。\n鸣珠佩晓衣，镂璧轮开扇。\n华冠列绮筵，兰醑申芳宴。\n环阶凤乐陈，玳席珍羞荐。\n蝶舞袖香新，歌分落素尘。\n欢凝欢懿戚，庆叶庆初姻。\n暑阑炎气息，凉早吹疎频。\n方期六合泰，共赏万年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}